    // own X tracks worldX every frame (see the stops loop, far below),
    // and nothing ever paused that drift just because a visitor was
    // hovering one, trying to click it -- confirmed directly, the same
    // ~20px/s baseline (faster still after idle ramps it up) ran
    // whether or not the cursor was sitting right on a stop. Fragments
    // already get this courtesy ("a fragment holds while something is
    // near it," FIELD-SPEC.md); the seven stops are this site's real
    // navigation (CLAUDE.md non-negotiable 2) and got none of it. Set
